          hero: {
            title: 'BĂO HUÁNG',
            subtitle: 'Traitor in the Court',
            tagline: '168 cards. Five players. Two Loyalists. One hidden traitor. Will the Emperor escape?',
          },
          shortDescription: "Enter the high-stakes world of Shandong's premier social game. Bao Huang is a masterpiece of hidden roles and climbing strategy. As part of a 168-card marathon, you must deduce your allies, bury your low cards in massive sets, and use the power of the Eunuch to sabotage the Commoners' uprising.",
