          ai: 'Game: Băo Huáng. Type: Climbing/Hidden-Role. Players: 5. Deck: 168 cards. Roles: Emperor/Eunuch vs 3 Commoners. Goal: Shed all cards. Feature: Eunuch is hidden until playing the special Black Joker.',
